    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8927": {
      "title": "Full-Time Building Service Worker 2 - Building Services",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Full-Time Building Service Worker 2 - Building Services Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Full-Time Building Service Worker 2 - Building Services Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Full-Time Building Service Worker 2 - Building Services Job Description Cleaning and maintaining living facilities, dining areas, laundry areas, restrooms, shower areas, classrooms and offices. Replenishing soap and paper products. Removing trash and recycling from buildings while replacing liners in the trash and recycling containers. Sweeping, mopping and cleaning floors and stairwells. Vacuuming and shampooing carpeted areas. Dusting furniture, washing walls and windows. Cleaning outside steps and entryways (may include snow removal from entryways).Moving heavy furniture, supplies and equipment. Burnishing, refinishing and stripping tile and terrazzo flooring. Reporting items in need of repair and ordering supplies. Performing related or special duties as assigned by a supervisor. Required Qualifications Must be dependable, trustworthy, flexible and a team player. Able to work effectively in an environment subject to frequently changing priorities. Ability to operate power equipment (vacuum cleaners, carpet extractors, high and low speed burnishers, auto scrubbers and other possible equipment used in connection with building cleaning). Applicant must have reliable transportation. Attention to detail is critical. Availability to work weekends as needed. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Exposure to external temperatures during the cleaning of entrances or around the perimeter of the building and exposure to heat/humidity during summer months. Ability to lift boxes, trash, ladders and equipment. Ability to perform tasks in high, low and confined spaces. Exposure to chemicals in cleaning products, dust, dirt and germs. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 10/20/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 40 Shift Required? First Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1155P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 10/20/2026 Job Open Date Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8911 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Letter of Recommendation 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
