      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Casual Game Operations Staff - Athletics Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Casual Game Operations Staff - Athletics Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Casual Game Operations Staff - Athletics Job Description The Ashland University Athletics Department is seeking reliable and responsible game operations staff for the academic year. Assist the department at a number of athletic contests and are an integral part of the operation. Hours and days vary depending on game schedules. Positions include but are not limited to: ushers, scoreboard operators, music, ball crew, gate attendants, ticket operations staff, etc. Required Qualifications Pleasant disposition & customer service skills. Ability to work evenings and weekends. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Some positions require applicants to lift heavier objects Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/01/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week Varies Shift Required? Varied Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S665P Number of Vacancies 20 Desired Start Date 08/01/2026 Job Open Date 10/01/2024 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/5084 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be