    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8883": {
      "title": "Full-Time PM Grill Cook - Eagles Nest",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Full-Time PM Grill Cook - Eagles Nest Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Full-Time PM Grill Cook - Eagles Nest Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Full-Time PM Grill Cook - Eagles Nest Job Description Prepare orders from in-house orders as well as Grubhub orders throughout the lunch and dinner service from 3:30 pm to 12:00 am Monday – Thursday, and 10:30 am – 7:00 pm Friday. Set up station for the day, prep any items needed for service. Maintain a clean and organized station throughout service. Oversee and mentor student employees providing training and guidance. Assist is scheduling shift for student workers. Monitor student performance and provide feedback to ensure high standards of service. Assist in monthly Inventory counting and monitor stock rotation and expiration to minimize waste. Collaborate with management to promote grill events, specials, and new menu items. Assist in creating and distributing promotional material, engaging with customers and gathering feedback. Required Qualifications High School diploma or equivalent. Strong leadership and supervisory skills. Basic understanding of inventory and stock management. Good communication skills and a positive attitude. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Previous grill cook experience preferred. Food Safety certified. Previous work in a high volume environment. Physical Demands Area can be hot and fast paced. Bending, twisting, and standing for long periods. Ability to lift 30 lbs. or more. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 10/12/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 40 Shift Required? Third Job Duties Posting Detail Information