      "description": "Ashland University Portal | FT AM Swing Shift Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home FT AM Swing Shift Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title FT AM Swing Shift Job Description Working in multiple positions to relieve employees on their day off. Performs duties that include producing quality products and presenting them using proper techniques. Heat, portion and serve food to students according to established procedures. Complete production records and maintain sanitation standards for all stages of food preparation. Responsible for prep as needed, and ensuring all unused products are properly labeled, stored and recorded. Required Qualifications Ability to read and follow directions. Attention to detail Great work ethic Preferred Qualifications Knowledge of food safety Physical Demands Bending, lifting, standing for long periods of time. Tolerance to extreme heat when working in and around kitchen environment. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 10/20/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 40 Shift Required? First Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1151P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 10/20/2026 Job Open Date Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8903 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Letter of Recommendation 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved