    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8931": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor of Chemistry - College of Arts and Sciences",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Assistant Professor of Chemistry - College of Arts and Sciences Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Assistant Professor of Chemistry - College of Arts and Sciences Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Assistant Professor of Chemistry - College of Arts and Sciences Division College of Arts & Sciences (CAS) Department Chemistry Job Description The Department of Chemistry, Geology, and Physics at Ashland University ( www.ashland.edu ) invites applications for a Tenure-track Assistant Professor of Chemistry position beginning August 2027, Ph.D. required. Candidates with inorganic chemistry and/or analytical chemistry specialization are preferred, but candidates who can teach courses in general chemistry, nursing chemistry, and inorganic chemistry will be considered. The Chemistry Program offers courses for chemistry, biochemistry, forensic chemistry, integrated science education, industrial engineering, biology, toxicology, nursing, and pre-health majors, as well as courses in the University Core Curriculum. The teaching load is twelve (12) hours per semester and will focus on courses for majors and non-majors. Successful candidates will establish an undergraduate-focused research program. Submit a letter of application, undergraduate research proposal, CV, statement of teaching philosophy. Unofficial transcripts and three (3) confidential letters of reference should be emailed separately to chemistry@ashland.edu . Review of applications will begin immediately and will continue until the position is filled. Required Qualifications Ph.D. in Chemistry. Preferred Qualifications Candidates with inorganic chemistry and/or analytical chemistry specialization. Physical Demands Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/23/2027 Proposed Rank Assistant Tenure-Track Yes Service Basis 9 month Fixed Term Yes Term Start Date 08/23/2027 Term End Date 05/12/2028 Benefits Yes Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number F131P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 08/23/2027 Job Open Date Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8918 Reference Collection References Minimum Requests Maximum Requests Recommendation Deadline Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Letter of Recommendation Curriculum Vitae Letter of Application Teaching Statement Research Statement Unofficial Transcripts Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
