    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8875": {
      "title": "Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Rate of pay for this position is $13.50/hr. Position Details Position Information Position Title Part-Time AM Pasta Server - Student Dining Job Description Prepare pasta, sauces, breadsticks, and toppings needed for daily production. Complete related paperwork to document accurate product usage, and temp logs. Maintain safe food temperatures throughout meal period. Rotation of product, clean up and sanitation of area during and after shift. Perform other duties as requested by management. 7:00 a.m. – 1:30 p.m. Monday-Friday; every other weekend 11:00 a.m. – 7:30 p.m. Required Qualifications Performs the duties in an efficient and positive manner. Meets the objectives of Ashland University and the needs of the student customer. Follows state health department guidelines and dress codes. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Detail oriented, reliable as well as a self-starter. Able to work with little or no supervision. Physical Demands Bending, lifting, standing for long periods. Tolerance to extreme heat when working in and around a kitchen environment. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 10/05/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 29 Shift Required? Varied Job Duties Job Duty Name Optional cleaning Description of Job Duty Deep cleaning of stations and related areas during shut down and summer break. May be asked to work in other Auxiliary operations as needed. Essential Duty? Yes Percentage Of Time 10 Posting Detail Information Posting Numb