    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8968": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor of Music, Tenure Track - College of Arts and Sciences",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Assistant Professor of Music, Tenure Track - College of Arts and Sciences Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Assistant Professor of Music, Tenure Track - College of Arts and Sciences Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Assistant Professor of Music, Tenure Track - College of Arts and Sciences Division College of Arts & Sciences (CAS) Department Music Job Description Ashland University invites application for an Assistant Professor of Music and Director of Choral Activities. This full-time, 9-month tenure track position will begin August 2027. The ideal candidate will have successful college-level teaching experience and successful high school teaching experience. Responsibilities include conducting at least two choral ensembles, teaching in the areas of conducting, music education, and related areas commensurate with the candidate’s qualifications, producing a traditional Madrigal Feaste, and the usual duties associated with running a choral program. Required Qualifications D.M.A., Ph.D., or Ed.D. in choral conducting or music education; ABD considered. Successful college-level and high school teaching experience. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 08/23/2027 Proposed Rank Assistant Tenure-Track Yes Service Basis 9 month Fixed Term Term Start Date 08/23/2027 Term End Date 05/12/2028 Benefits Yes Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number F134P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 08/23/2027 Job Open Date 10/21/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8967 Reference Collection References Minimum Requests Maximum Requests Recommendation Deadline Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Letter of Application Unofficial Transcripts Letters Of Recommendation Optional Documents 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
