    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/9009": {
      "title": "Casual Bartender - Catering &amp; Conferences",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Casual Bartender - Catering &amp; Conferences Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Casual Bartender - Catering & Conferences Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Rate of pay for this position is $15.00/hr. Position Details Position Information Position Title Casual Bartender - Catering & Conferences Job Description Bartender for catered events such as wedding receptions, corporate holiday parties, and University functions. Bartenders set up and pull their own bars for each event. All bars are mobile, requiring the pulling and restocking of all alcohol, mixers, and garnishes before and after each event. Bartenders serve cocktails, beer, and wine. Required Qualifications Must be 21 years or older. Qualified candidates must possess natural ability to serve guests in an upscale dining environment. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Bartending experience preferred but not required. Experience handling cash and credit cards preferred but not required. Physical Demands Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 11/09/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 10 Shift Required? Varied Job Duties Posting Detail Information Posting Number S095P Number of Vacancies 10 Desired Start Date 11/09/2026 Job Open Date 08/02/2024 Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Rate of pay for this position is $15.00/hr. Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/827 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter 401 College Avenue Ashland, OH 44805 419.289.4142, 800.882.1548 Athletics Employment Commencement News Center Accessibility Back to top Wellness Consumer Information Student Complaints Campus Store To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
