    "https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/9013": {
      "title": "Part-Time PM Pizza - Student Dining",
      "description": "Ashland University Portal | Part-Time PM Pizza - Student Dining Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Ashland University Home Human Resources Home Part-Time PM Pizza - Student Dining Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Part-Time PM Pizza - Student Dining Job Description Prepare, press and assemble, pizza doughs, sauces and toppings for daily production. Bake pizzas as needed throughout meal period. Maintain safe temperatures throughout shift. Rotate and properly store product at end of shift. Clean and sanitize work station. Complete daily production sheet and temperature logs. Position works 2:00 p.m. to 8:00 p.m. Monday-Friday and every other weekend. Required Qualifications Performs the duties in efficient manner, meeting the objectives and needs of Ashland University. Must follow State health and safety guidelines to insure safe food handling. Applicant must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Ashland University will not sponsor or take over sponsorship for an employment visa. Preferred Qualifications Detail oriented, able to multi-task with little or no supervision in a busy environment. Physical Demands Bending, lifting, standing for long periods. Tolerance to extreme heat when working in and around a kitchen environment. Anticipated Start Date of New Hire 11/09/2026 Anticipated Number of Hours Working per Week 29 Shift Required? Varied Job Duties Job Duty Name Optional cleaning, and Concessions Description of Job Duty Essential Duty? No Percentage Of Time 10 Posting Detail Information Posting Number S1154P Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date 11/09/2026 Job Open Date Job Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Quick Link for Internal Postings https://jobs.ashland.edu/postings/8909 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed